  "title": "Baked Salami",
  "description": "Slice a salami partially through into thin slices, bake it with a sweet barbecue sauce, and let guests slice off their own servings of baked salami and enjoy it with crackers for an easy-to-make appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathy Bezemes Walstrom"
  ],
